{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CYvWgqByDpsiBBCxnFvxKe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。三条 Claim 无需调整。Headline: \"IRT-FIT achieves |d|>2.5\n2\t  across 4 model families at 15% contamination using only binary responses, and retains\n3\t  detection power after RL — structurally immune to the failure mode that invalidates\n4\t  all log-prob methods.\" ctrl-contam 跨 4 家族 + 3 benchmarks 全面验证，θ-fixed 在所有家族恢复单调剂量-响应，memorization\n5\t  fraction 跨家族一致（30-40%），post-RL 结构性优势确认， baseline comparison 表收到 5+ baselines 且 lz*\n6\t  在低污染区间竞争力强。EMNLP 投稿无需妥协。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen2.5-7B × MMLU)\n11\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n12\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × MMLU, 5 conditions (0%×3 seeds / 15% / 50%)。\n13\t    Go/no-go 信号，验证 Δlz* 显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、seen/unseen memorization fraction。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    clean_s1_lz_star: 9.47\n18\t    clean_s2_lz_star: 7.05\n19\t    clean_s3_lz_star: 9.53\n20\t    clean_mean_lz_star: 8.68\n21\t    clean_std_lz_star: 1.41\n22\t    contam_15_lz_star: 3.85\n23\t    contam_50_lz_star: 7.29\n24\t    cohens_d_contam_15_ddof1: -3.42\n25\t    cohens_d_contam_50_ddof1: -0.99\n26\t    contam_15_acc: 0.731\n27\t    contam_50_acc: 0.764\n28\t    clean_mean_acc: 0.679\n29\t    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.38\n30\t    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.29\n31\t    theta_fixed_value: -0.097\n32\t    theta_fixed_contam_15_lz_star: 11.85\n33\t    theta_fixed_contam_50_lz_star: 18.58\n34\t    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio: 3.12\n35\t    theta_fixed_monotonic: true\n36\t    seen_unseen_fingerprint: seen lz*≈0, unseen lz*≈3.1 at 15%\n37\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 基线 misfit 较高（clean lz*≈8.68），这是因为 Qwen 家族经过大规模多阶段训练，\n38\t    其 response pattern 本身就强烈偏离 4PL 预测。QLoRA SFT 15% 注入使模型记住约 38% 的 seen items （SFT\n39\t    泛化效应：不是所有注入 items 都被死记硬背），这些 memorized items 从 aberrant 变为 expected， 拉低 lz*（从\n40\t    8.68 降到 3.85），产生 |d|=3.42 的强效应。50% 注入时 θ-shift 效应主导：θ_MLE 大幅上升 （Δθ=0.47），re-estimated\n41\t    θ 吸收了大部分 aberrance signal，导致 free-θ 下 d 仅 0.99（非单调）。 但 θ-fixed 分析（固定 θ 为 clean\n42\t    baseline）恢复单调：contam_15 Δlz*=3.17, contam_50 Δlz*=9.89， ratio=3.12，因为此时 θ-shift\n43\t    confound 被消除，纯 memorization signal 正确累积。 seen/unseen 分离是最清晰的指纹：memorized items\n44\t    的 response pattern 从 aberrant 变为 model-predicted， 而 unseen items 保持或加剧 aberrance（因\n45\t    θ-shift 导致 ability 高估）。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t  tables:\n49\t  - name: 'Table: Qwen Pilot — Δlz* by Condition'\n50\t    columns:\n51\t    - condition\n52\t    - lz*_corrected\n53\t    - Δlz*\n54\t    - Cohen's_d\n55\t    - θ_MLE\n56\t    - Δθ\n57\t    - acc\n58\t    - memo_frac\n59\t    rows:\n60\t    - - clean (n=3)\n61\t      - 8.68±1.41\n62\t      - —\n63\t      - —\n64\t      - '-0.097'\n65\t      - —\n66\t      - '0.679'\n67\t      - —\n68\t    - - contam_15\n69\t      - '3.85'\n70\t      - '-4.83'\n71\t      - '-3.42'\n72\t      - '0.193'\n73\t      - '+0.29'\n74\t      - '0.731'\n75\t      - '0.38'\n76\t    - - contam_50\n77\t      - '7.29'\n78\t      - '-1.39'\n79\t      - '-0.99'\n80\t      - '0.373'\n81\t      - '+0.47'\n82\t      - '0.764'\n83\t      - '0.29'\n84\t  - name: 'Table: θ-fixed Analysis'\n85\t    columns:\n86\t    - condition\n87\t    - lz*_fixed\n88\t    - Δlz*_fixed\n89\t    - ratio_vs_15\n90\t    rows:\n91\t    - - clean\n92\t      - '8.68'\n93\t      - —\n94\t      - —\n95\t    - - contam_15\n96\t      - '11.85'\n97\t      - '+3.17'\n98\t      - 1.0×\n99\t    - - contam_50\n100\t      - '18.58'\n101\t      - '+9.89'\n102\t      - 3.12×\n103\t  figures_description:\n104\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response comparison — free-θ (non-monotonic) vs θ-fixed (monotonic),\n105\t    dual y-axis showing lz* and θ_MLE shift'\n106\t  - 'Fig: Seen vs unseen item lz* decomposition at 15% and 50%'\n107\t  analysis: 'Go/no-go 信号明确通过。d=3.42 远超 Cohen''s d=0.8 大效应阈值。θ-shift 机制是方法论贡献： 它解释了为什么\n108\t    free-θ dose-response 可能非单调，以及如何通过 θ-fixed 恢复正确检测特性。 memorization_fraction=0.38\n109\t    意味着 power function 的 upper bound 需要乘以 0.38 才得到 adjusted power——理论预测与实测吻合。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t- name: Full Controlled Contamination (4 Families × 3 Benchmarks × 6 Levels)\n113\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n114\t  description: '4 模型家族 (Qwen2.5-7B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-4-12B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) ×  6\n115\t    contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU/HellaSwag/GSM8K)。\n116\t    建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 全谱映射。每个 condition 3 seeds。\n117\t\n118\t    '\n119\t  expected_results:\n120\t    mmlu_qwen_d_15: -3.42\n121\t    mmlu_qwen_d_50: -0.99\n122\t    mmlu_qwen_d_5: -1.15\n123\t    mmlu_qwen_d_10: -2.3\n124\t    mmlu_qwen_d_25: -2.85\n125\t    mmlu_llama_d_15: -2.95\n126\t    mmlu_llama_d_50: -3.31\n127\t    mmlu_llama_d_5: -1.05\n128\t    mmlu_llama_d_10: -2.1\n129\t    mmlu_llama_d_25: -3.15\n130\t    mmlu_gemma_d_15: -3.2\n131\t    mmlu_gemma_d_50: -2.65\n132\t    mmlu_gemma_d_5: -1.1\n133\t    mmlu_gemma_d_10: -2.25\n134\t    mmlu_gemma_d_25: -3.05\n135\t    mmlu_mistral_d_15: -2.8\n136\t    mmlu_mistral_d_50: -2.5\n137\t    mmlu_mistral_d_5: -0.95\n138\t    mmlu_mistral_d_10: -1.95\n139\t    mmlu_mistral_d_25: -2.7\n140\t    mmlu_d_15_min_across_families: 2.8\n141\t    mmlu_d_15_mean_across_families: 3.09\n142\t    mmlu_n_families_d_gt_2_at_15pct: 4\n143\t    hellaswag_qwen_d_15: -2.35\n144\t    hellaswag_llama_d_15: -1.9\n145\t    hellaswag_gemma_d_15: -2.15\n146\t    hellaswag_mistral_d_15: -1.75\n147\t    hellaswag_d_15_mean: 2.04\n148\t    hellaswag_qwen_d_50: -1.7\n149\t    hellaswag_llama_d_50: -2.55\n150\t    hellaswag_gemma_d_50: -2.3\n151\t    hellaswag_mistral_d_50: -2.1\n152\t    gsm8k_qwen_d_15: -1.65\n153\t    gsm8k_llama_d_15: -1.3\n154\t    gsm8k_gemma_d_15: -1.5\n155\t    gsm8k_mistral_d_15: -1.15\n156\t    gsm8k_d_15_mean: 1.4\n157\t    gsm8k_qwen_d_50: -1.2\n158\t    gsm8k_llama_d_50: -1.8\n159\t    gsm8k_gemma_d_50: -1.6\n160\t    gsm8k_mistral_d_50: -1.45\n161\t    ctrl_contam_cohens_d_15pct_min_across_families: 2.8\n162\t    ctrl_contam_cohens_d_15pct_mean_across_families: 3.09\n163\t    n_families_d_gt_2: 4\n164\t    multi_benchmark_cohens_d_15pct_hellaswag: 2.04\n165\t    multi_benchmark_cohens_d_15pct_gsm8k: 1.4\n166\t    theta_fixed_monotonic_families: 4\n167\t    theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n168\t    theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n169\t    theta_fixed_gemma_monotonic: true\n170\t    theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: true\n171\t    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio_range:\n172\t    - 2.5\n173\t    - 3.5\n174\t    memorization_fraction_qwen_15: 0.38\n175\t    memorization_fraction_llama_15: 0.35\n176\t    memorization_fraction_gemma_15: 0.36\n177\t    memorization_fraction_mistral_15: 0.33\n178\t    memorization_fraction_cross_family_mean: 0.355\n179\t    memorization_fraction_range:\n180\t    - 0.33\n181\t    - 0.38\n182\t    power_theory_vs_observed_R2: 0.94\n183\t    adjusted_power_mmlu_15pct: 0.37\n184\t    theoretical_upper_bound_mmlu_15pct: 0.98\n185\t  result_rationale: '四个家族在 MMLU 上均产生 |d|>2.5 的检测信号，原因是 QLoRA SFT 的 memorization 机制跨家族一致：\n186\t    无论模型架构（Qwen=grouped-query attention, Llama=RoPE+GQA, Gemma=sliding window,  Mistral=sliding\n187\t    window attention），SFT 在 1-3 epochs 内均会将约 33-38% 的注入 items 从 \"能力匹配的随机正确/错误\" 变为\n188\t    \"确定性正确\"，产生与 IRT 4PL 预测的系统性偏离。\n189\t\n190\t    家族间差异由 baseline misfit 幅度调控：Qwen 基线 lz*≈8.68（高 misfit）使得 free-θ 非单调更明显；Llama 基线\n191\t    lz*≈-0.14（接近 0）使得 free-θ 基本单调。Gemma 和 Mistral  预期基线 misfit 在 2-6 之间（中等），free-θ\n192\t    行为介于两者之间。但 θ-fixed 在所有家族恢复单调， 因为固定 θ 消除了 θ-shift confound 这个唯一的干扰因素。\n193\t\n194\t    HellaSwag 效应弱于 MMLU（d_15 mean=2.04 vs 3.09），原因：(a) items 数少（~10K vs 14K）， lz*\n195\t    方差 ∝ 1/√n，信号-噪声比降低；(b) HellaSwag 是 sentence completion 任务，SFT memorization 的 transfer\n196\t    pattern 可能不同于 MMLU 的 multiple-choice 格式。但仍在 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内。\n197\t\n198\t    GSM8K 效应最弱（d_15 mean=1.40），因为仅 ~1.3K items，接近 power function 预测的 min_items_15pct_80power=7958\n199\t    的下限。但 |d|>1.0 仍是大效应，且与理论 power function 吻合（R²=0.94），验证了 Claim 2 \"detection power\n200\t    is a predictable function of n_items\"。\n201\t\n202\t    memorization_fraction 跨家族一致（0.33-0.38）的理论解释：QLoRA 的 low-rank bottleneck （rank=16-64）限制了\n203\t    SFT 的记忆容量，使得不同家族模型在相同注入量下记住相似比例的 items。 这个一致性支持了 \"memorization fraction 是 SFT\n204\t    过程的通用属性\" 这一论点。\n205\t\n206\t    '\n207\t  tables:\n208\t  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d at 15% Contamination (4 Families × 3 Benchmarks)'\n209\t    columns:\n210\t    - Family\n211\t    - MMLU (14K)\n212\t    - HellaSwag (10K)\n213\t    - GSM8K (1.3K)\n214\t    - memo_frac\n215\t    rows:\n216\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n217\t      - '-3.42'\n218\t      - '-2.35'\n219\t      - '-1.65'\n220\t      - '0.38'\n221\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n222\t      - '-2.95'\n223\t      - '-1.90'\n224\t      - '-1.30'\n225\t      - '0.35'\n226\t    - - Gemma-4-12B\n227\t      - '-3.20'\n228\t      - '-2.15'\n229\t      - '-1.50'\n230\t      - '0.36'\n231\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n232\t      - '-2.80'\n233\t      - '-1.75'\n234\t      - '-1.15'\n235\t      - '0.33'\n236\t    - - '**Mean**'\n237\t      - '**-3.09**'\n238\t      - '**-2.04**'\n239\t      - '**-1.40**'\n240\t      - '**0.355**'\n241\t    - - '**Min |d|**'\n242\t      - '**2.80**'\n243\t      - '**1.75**'\n244\t      - '**1.15**'\n245\t      - —\n246\t  - name: 'Table: Full Dose-Response (MMLU, θ-fixed, 4 Families)'\n247\t    columns:\n248\t    - Family\n249\t    - d_5%\n250\t    - d_10%\n251\t    - d_15%\n252\t    - d_25%\n253\t    - d_50%\n254\t    - monotonic\n255\t    rows:\n256\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n257\t      - '1.15'\n258\t      - '2.30'\n259\t      - '3.42'\n260\t      - '4.85'\n261\t      - '9.89'\n262\t      - ✓\n263\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n264\t      - '0.90'\n265\t      - '1.85'\n266\t      - '2.95'\n267\t      - '4.50'\n268\t      - '8.75'\n269\t      - ✓\n270\t    - - Gemma-4-12B\n271\t      - '1.00'\n272\t      - '2.05'\n273\t      - '3.20'\n274\t      - '4.65'\n275\t      - '9.30'\n276\t      - ✓\n277\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n278\t      - '0.85'\n279\t      - '1.75'\n280\t      - '2.80'\n281\t      - '4.20'\n282\t      - '8.40'\n283\t      - ✓\n284\t  - name: 'Table: Seen/Unseen Memorization Split at 15% (MMLU)'\n285\t    columns:\n286\t    - Family\n287\t    - Δacc_seen\n288\t    - Δacc_unseen\n289\t    - seen_lz*\n290\t    - unseen_lz*\n291\t    - memo_frac\n292\t    rows:\n293\t    - - Qwen\n294\t      - '+0.142'\n295\t      - '+0.010'\n296\t      - ≈0\n297\t      - '+3.1'\n298\t      - '0.38'\n299\t    - - Llama\n300\t      - '+0.135'\n301\t      - '+0.008'\n302\t      - ≈0\n303\t      - '+2.8'\n304\t      - '0.35'\n305\t    - - Gemma\n306\t      - '+0.138'\n307\t      - '+0.009'\n308\t      - ≈0\n309\t      - '+2.9'\n310\t      - '0.36'\n311\t    - - Mistral\n312\t      - '+0.128'\n313\t      - '+0.006'\n314\t      - ≈0\n315\t      - '+2.6'\n316\t      - '0.33'\n317\t  figures_description:\n318\t  - 'Fig: 4-panel dose-response curves (one per family), θ-fixed, MMLU+HellaSwag+GSM8K\n319\t    overlaid, showing monotonic increase and benchmark-size effect'\n320\t  - 'Fig: Cross-family Cohen''s d heatmap (4 families × 3 benchmarks × 6 levels),\n321\t    color-coded by effect size'\n322\t  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction consistency plot — bar chart across 4 families showing\n323\t    0.33-0.38 range with error bars'\n324\t  - 'Fig: Theoretical power (upper bound) vs adjusted power (× memo_frac) vs observed\n325\t    detection rate, three curves per benchmark'\n326\t  analysis: '这是论文的核心实验。4/4 家族 |d|>2.0 at 15% 直接验证 Claim 1 的跨家族泛化。 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K\n327\t    的检测力与 benchmark size 的关系验证 Claim 2 的 power function。 θ-fixed 4/4 家族单调是方法论贡献的关键证据。memorization\n328\t    fraction 0.33-0.38 的跨家族一致性 弥合了 theoretical upper bound 与 observed detection 之间的\n329\t    gap（R²=0.94）， 完成 Claim 2 的 \"predictable power function\" 论证。\n330\t\n331\t    '\n332\t- name: Leaderboard Audit (ABANDONED)\n333\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n334\t  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描。因 D011 (v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111) 和 item\n335\t    alignment 54.56% 导致不可行，已放弃。数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t  expected_results:\n339\t    status: ABANDONED\n340\t    reason: IRT refit discrimination failure (a_r=0.111 << 0.2 threshold) + item alignment\n341\t      54.56%\n342\t    paper_treatment: 'Discussion/Future Work: 13K+ per-item data publicly available\n343\t      for future large-scale audits'\n344\t  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，v1 IRT refit 的 discrimination 参数仍然不可能达标（a_r 需 >0.4），\n345\t    因为经典 IRT (MML-EM) 和 neural IRT (PSN-IRT) 的估计基于根本不同的优化目标和样本量要求。 N=178 的经典 IRT 样本远不足以恢复\n346\t    neural IRT 在 N=12 精选模型上的区分度。 这是一个关于 classical vs neural IRT estimation 的 methodological\n347\t    caveat， 本身就是贡献（Claim 3c）。在 best tier，ctrl-contam 提供了比 leaderboard audit  更强的验证（ground\n348\t    truth），使得 audit 变为 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。\n349\t\n350\t    '\n351\t  tables: []\n352\t  figures_description: []\n353\t  analysis: 'Abandoned 不影响 best 档叙事。ctrl-contam 是 primary validation，leaderboard audit  是\n354\t    future work。13K+ 数据可用性作为 \"IRT-FIT uniquely suited for retrospective audit\"  的论据保留在\n355\t    Discussion 中。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t- name: Base→Chat Natural Experiment (v1 Leaderboard Pairs)\n359\t  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n360\t  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 自然实验。计算 Δlz* = lz*(chat) - lz*(base)  作为\n361\t    SFT 效应代理。P2-optional。\n362\t\n363\t    '\n364\t  expected_results:\n365\t    n_pairs: 21\n366\t    n_complete_pairs: 9\n367\t    hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n368\t    hellaswag_t_stat: -3.97\n369\t    hellaswag_p_value: 0.001\n370\t    gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.92\n371\t    gsm8k_t_stat: 3.35\n372\t    gsm8k_p_value: 0.009\n373\t    mmlu_p_value: 0.15\n374\t    arc_c_p_value: 0.38\n375\t    individual_outliers: 0\n376\t  result_rationale: 'HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 显示系统性 SFT 效应的原因：(a) HellaSwag 的 sentence completion  任务格式使得\n377\t    chat-tuned 模型的 response pattern 系统性偏离 base model（instruction  following 改变了选择策略），产生负向\n378\t    Δlz*；(b) GSM8K 的数学推理任务在 chat tuning 中 经常被加强（chain-of-thought data 常包含 GSM8K-style\n379\t    problems），产生正向 Δlz*。 MMLU 和 ARC-C 不显著是因为 SFT 对这两个 benchmark 的 response pattern\n380\t    影响更分散， 不同 subject domains 的效应相互抵消。在 best tier 下，这些结果作为 ctrl-contam 的 补充证据——自然\n381\t    SFT 确实改变 person-fit，但不如 controlled contamination 那么强或定向。 没有单个 pair 显示 benchmark-specific\n382\t    contamination outlier 说明自然 SFT 的效应是 distributed 而非 memorization-like。\n383\t\n384\t    '\n385\t  tables:\n386\t  - name: 'Table: Base→Chat Δlz* by Benchmark'\n387\t    columns:\n388\t    - Benchmark\n389\t    - Mean Δlz*\n390\t    - t-stat\n391\t    - p-value\n392\t    - Interpretation\n393\t    rows:\n394\t    - - HellaSwag\n395\t      - '-3.40'\n396\t      - '-3.97'\n397\t      - '0.001'\n398\t      - SFT systematically decreases lz*\n399\t    - - GSM8K\n400\t      - '+3.92'\n401\t      - '+3.35'\n402\t      - '0.009'\n403\t      - SFT systematically increases lz*\n404\t    - - MMLU\n405\t      - '+1.85'\n406\t      - '+1.52'\n407\t      - '0.15'\n408\t      - Not significant\n409\t    - - ARC-C\n410\t      - '-0.72'\n411\t      - '-0.91'\n412\t      - '0.38'\n413\t      - Not significant\n414\t  figures_description:\n415\t  - 'Fig: Paired Δlz* scatter plot (base vs chat) per benchmark, highlighting systematic\n416\t    shift direction'\n417\t  analysis: 'P2-optional 补充实验。在 best 档叙事中作为 \"SFT changes person-fit profiles\" 的 converging\n418\t    evidence，支持 ctrl-contam 的 mechanistic story，但不是核心依据。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178, Path D Closure)\n422\t  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n423\t  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N=178。最终确认 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。 关闭 Path\n424\t    D。\n425\t\n426\t    '\n427\t  expected_results:\n428\t    n_models_downloaded: 178\n429\t    n_items: 14042\n430\t    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.127\n431\t    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.029\n432\t    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.663\n433\t    a_r_threshold_met: false\n434\t    path_d_conclusion: dead\n435\t    b_r_partial_validation: 0.663\n436\t  result_rationale: 'N=178 仍远不足以弥合经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 的 discrimination 估计差异。原因： (a)\n437\t    MML-EM 在 N=178 heterogeneous LLMs 上估计的 a_r 反映的是 \"average discriminability  across\n438\t    very different response strategies\"，而 PSN-IRT 在 N=12 curated models 上 用 deep learning\n439\t    捕获的是 \"local discriminability near the ability frontier\"—— 两种估计回答的是不同问题。(b) b_r=0.663\n440\t    部分验证成功是因为 item difficulty 是一个 更 robust 的参数（在 item 排序上，classical 和 neural 估计更一致），而\n441\t    discrimination 需要模型在 ability frontier 附近有足够密度的采样点。(c) 即使 N→500+，a_r 预计仍 <0.2，\n442\t    因为根本问题是 heterogeneity 而非 sample size。 在 best tier 下这是一个 positive negative result：它量化了\n443\t    classical-vs-neural IRT  的 sample size gap，motivates future work on neural IRT\n444\t    scaling。\n445\t\n446\t    '\n447\t  tables:\n448\t  - name: 'Table: IRT Refit — Pilot vs Expanded'\n449\t    columns:\n450\t    - Metric\n451\t    - Pilot (N=63)\n452\t    - Expanded (N=178)\n453\t    - Threshold\n454\t    rows:\n455\t    - - 3PL a_r (Pearson)\n456\t      - '0.111'\n457\t      - '0.127'\n458\t      - '>0.4'\n459\t    - - 2PL a_r (Pearson)\n460\t      - '-0.084'\n461\t      - '-0.029'\n462\t      - '>0.4'\n463\t    - - 3PL b_r (Pearson)\n464\t      - '0.626'\n465\t      - '0.663'\n466\t      - '>0.5 ✓'\n467\t  figures_description:\n468\t  - 'Fig: a_r vs sample size (N=63, 178), extrapolation curve showing convergence\n469\t    well below threshold'\n470\t  analysis: 'Path D 最终关闭。b_r 部分验证 + a_r 失败 → Claim 3c 的内容： \"IRT parameter estimation\n471\t    challenges — quantifying the sample size gap between  classical and neural IRT\n472\t    estimation in LLM contexts.\"\n473\t\n474\t    '\n475\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) Ablation\n476\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n477\t  description: '比较 4PL 和 3PL(d=1) 下的检测灵敏度。量化 feasibility parameter d 对 false alarm\n478\t    rate 和 detection power 的影响。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t  expected_results:\n482\t    far_4pl: 0.05\n483\t    far_3pl: 4.7-16.5%\n484\t    far_2pl: 50-100%\n485\t    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_mmlu: +27.3pp\n486\t    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_hellaswag: +26.1pp\n487\t    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_gsm8k: +20.3pp\n488\t    pct_mmlu_items_d_lt_095: 0.46\n489\t    most_affected_model: DeepSeek-V3 (Δlz*=357)\n490\t    real_data_correlation_4pl_vs_3pl: 0.225\n491\t    real_data_rmse: 68.41\n492\t  result_rationale: '4PL d parameter 对 LLM contamination detection 至关重要的原因：LLM 不是人类考生，\n493\t    它们对某些 items 有系统性的 \"blind spots\"（即使 ability 很高也无法正确回答）。 4PL 的 d parameter（upper\n494\t    asymptote < 1.0）建模了这种 ceiling effect。 46% 的 MMLU items 有 d<0.95，意味着近一半 items 的\n495\t    \"满分\" 低于 1.0。 忽略 d (3PL, d=1) 会使高能力模型的 few-error pattern 被严重高估为 aberrant （因为 model\n496\t    预期 P(correct)→1.0 但 data 允许 P<1.0），inflating false alarm rate。 在 contamination\n497\t    detection 中，这相当于把 \"正常的 ceiling effect miss\" 误判为  \"contamination signal\"，halving\n498\t    detection power 因为 signal-to-noise ratio 被 inflated FAR 压缩。2PL 完全 miscalibrated\n499\t    因为同时忽略了 guessing (c) 和 ceiling (d)。\n500\t\n501\t    '\n502\t  tables:\n503\t  - name: 'Table: Power Comparison at 25% Contamination'\n504\t    columns:\n505\t    - Benchmark\n506\t    - 4PL Power\n507\t    - 3PL Power\n508\t    - Gain\n509\t    rows:\n510\t    - - MMLU\n511\t      - '0.776'\n512\t      - '0.329'\n513\t      - +44.7pp\n514\t    - - HellaSwag\n515\t      - '0.534'\n516\t      - '0.280'\n517\t      - +25.4pp\n518\t    - - GSM8K\n519\t      - '0.730'\n520\t      - '0.334'\n521\t      - +39.6pp\n522\t    - - ARC-C\n523\t      - '0.132'\n524\t      - '0.091'\n525\t      - +4.1pp\n526\t    - - HumanEval\n527\t      - '0.318'\n528\t      - '0.165'\n529\t      - +15.3pp\n530\t  figures_description:\n531\t  - 'Fig: Side-by-side power curves (4PL vs 3PL) across contamination levels, per\n532\t    benchmark'\n533\t  - 'Fig: Item-level Δlz*(4PL-3PL) vs d parameter scatter, showing d<0.95 items drive\n534\t    divergence'\n535\t  analysis: '4PL ablation 是 Reviewer R8 的直接回应。在 best 档中，这个结果为 \"why 4PL, not 3PL\"  提供了定量理由，同时揭示了一个更广泛的\n536\t    insight：LLM person-fit analysis 必须考虑 upper asymptote，因为 LLM 的 \"guessing and ceiling\n537\t    behavior\" 与人类根本不同。\n538\t\n539\t    '\n540\t- name: Baseline Comparison (≥5 Methods)\n541\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n542\t  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth models 上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines 的 AUROC/Type-I\n543\t    error。 Baselines: ConStat, Min-K%++, accuracy z-score, PPL-based, random。 Bootstrap\n544\t    CIs 作为差异化优势。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  expected_results:\n548\t    auroc_15pct_lz_star: 0.925\n549\t    auroc_15pct_min_k_pp: 0.96\n550\t    auroc_15pct_ppl: 0.915\n551\t    auroc_15pct_constat: 0.885\n552\t    auroc_15pct_acc_zscore: 0.775\n553\t    auroc_15pct_random: 0.5\n554\t    auroc_5pct_lz_star: 0.705\n555\t    auroc_5pct_min_k_pp: 0.745\n556\t    auroc_5pct_ppl: 0.68\n557\t    auroc_5pct_constat: 0.65\n558\t    auroc_5pct_acc_zscore: 0.575\n559\t    auroc_5pct_random: 0.5\n560\t    auroc_50pct_lz_star: 0.98\n561\t    auroc_50pct_min_k_pp: 0.995\n562\t    auroc_50pct_ppl: 0.985\n563\t    auroc_50pct_constat: 0.965\n564\t    auroc_50pct_acc_zscore: 0.92\n565\t    auroc_50pct_random: 0.5\n566\t    baseline_auroc_gap_at_15pct_vs_best_privileged: -0.035\n567\t    baseline_auroc_lz_at_5pct: 0.705\n568\t    lz_star_rank_at_5pct: 1\n569\t    lz_star_rank_at_15pct: 2\n570\t    lz_star_rank_at_50pct: 4\n571\t    ci_95_lz_star_15pct:\n572\t    - 0.885\n573\t    - 0.96\n574\t    ci_95_min_k_pp_15pct:\n575\t    - 0.93\n576\t    - 0.985\n577\t    ci_95_overlap_lz_vs_minkpp: true\n578\t    type_i_lz_star: 0.048\n579\t    type_i_min_k_pp: 0.052\n580\t    type_i_ppl: 0.055\n581\t    type_i_constat: 0.045\n582\t    type_i_acc_zscore: 0.035\n583\t  result_rationale: 'lz* 在 5% 低污染区间排名第一（AUROC=0.705），原因：在信号极弱时，IRT 的结构性归纳偏置 （item\n584\t    difficulty + discrimination + ability 的联合建模）比需要训练数据的 ML 方法 或依赖 token-level 信号的\n585\t    MIA 方法更能从噪声中提取微弱的 aberrance pattern。 具体机制：lz* 将每个 item response 按其 IRT-predicted\n586\t    probability 加权，使得 \"高难度 item 被正确回答\" 比 \"低难度 item 被正确回答\" 贡献更多检测信号。这种加权 在低污染时尤为关键——5%\n587\t    contamination 仅影响 ~700 items (MMLU)，其中 memorized  items (~250) 分散在不同难度层级，IRT 加权使得\n588\t    high-difficulty memorized items  的信号被放大，而 accuracy z-score 等方法对所有 items 等权处理，信号被稀释。\n589\t\n590\t    Min-K%++ 在 15%+ 超过 lz* 是因为 token-level probability 包含比 binary response  更丰富的信息——这正是\n591\t    \"minimal-information operating point\" 的代价所在。 但 gap 仅 -0.035 AUROC，且 95% CIs 重叠，说明\n592\t    binary-only 检测的代价远小于直觉预期。\n593\t\n594\t    PPL-based 和 ConStat 排在 lz* 之后或之间，因为 PPL 依赖 aggregated perplexity （丢失了 item-level\n595\t    结构），ConStat 依赖 re-test（需要额外推理开销）。\n596\t\n597\t    Bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行论文不报告的差异化优势——在 best tier，CI 重叠明确表明 \"lz* 在低污染区间与 privileged\n598\t    methods 竞争力相当\"，而非声称 superiority。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t  tables:\n602\t  - name: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU)'\n603\t    columns:\n604\t    - Method\n605\t    - Info Level\n606\t    - 5%\n607\t    - 10%\n608\t    - 15%\n609\t    - 25%\n610\t    - 50%\n611\t    - Avg\n612\t    rows:\n613\t    - - '**lz* (ours)**'\n614\t      - '**binary**'\n615\t      - '**0.705**'\n616\t      - '**0.830**'\n617\t      - '**0.925**'\n618\t      - '**0.965**'\n619\t      - '**0.980**'\n620\t      - '**0.881**'\n621\t    - - Min-K%++\n622\t      - token probs\n623\t      - '0.745'\n624\t      - '0.870'\n625\t      - '0.960'\n626\t      - '0.990'\n627\t      - '0.995'\n628\t      - '0.912'\n629\t    - - PPL-based\n630\t      - log-probs\n631\t      - '0.680'\n632\t      - '0.810'\n633\t      - '0.915'\n634\t      - '0.970'\n635\t      - '0.985'\n636\t      - '0.872'\n637\t    - - ConStat\n638\t      - re-test\n639\t      - '0.650'\n640\t      - '0.780'\n641\t      - '0.885'\n642\t      - '0.950'\n643\t      - '0.965'\n644\t      - '0.846'\n645\t    - - Acc z-score\n646\t      - binary\n647\t      - '0.575'\n648\t      - '0.680'\n649\t      - '0.775'\n650\t      - '0.885'\n651\t      - '0.920'\n652\t      - '0.767'\n653\t    - - Random\n654\t      - —\n655\t      - '0.500'\n656\t      - '0.500'\n657\t      - '0.500'\n658\t      - '0.500'\n659\t      - '0.500'\n660\t      - '0.500'\n661\t  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap 95% CIs at 15% (MMLU)'\n662\t    columns:\n663\t    - Method\n664\t    - AUROC\n665\t    - 95% CI\n666\t    - Type I\n667\t    rows:\n668\t    - - lz*\n669\t      - '0.925'\n670\t      - '[0.885, 0.960]'\n671\t      - '0.048'\n672\t    - - Min-K%++\n673\t      - '0.960'\n674\t      - '[0.930, 0.985]'\n675\t      - '0.052'\n676\t    - - PPL\n677\t      - '0.915'\n678\t      - '[0.870, 0.955]'\n679\t      - '0.055'\n680\t    - - ConStat\n681\t      - '0.885'\n682\t      - '[0.840, 0.925]'\n683\t      - '0.045'\n684\t    - - Acc z-score\n685\t      - '0.775'\n686\t      - '[0.720, 0.830]'\n687\t      - '0.035'\n688\t  - name: 'Table: Information Access Level Taxonomy'\n689\t    columns:\n690\t    - Level\n691\t    - Methods\n692\t    - Requires\n693\t    rows:\n694\t    - - Binary (minimal)\n695\t      - lz*, Acc z-score\n696\t      - Only correct/incorrect per item\n697\t    - - Re-test\n698\t      - ConStat\n699\t      - Second inference pass with rephrased items\n700\t    - - Token probs\n701\t      - Min-K%++\n702\t      - Per-token probability access\n703\t    - - Log-probs\n704\t      - PPL-based\n705\t      - Sequence-level log-probability\n706\t    - - Weights\n707\t      - Probing\n708\t      - Full model weight access\n709\t  figures_description:\n710\t  - 'Fig: AUROC vs contamination level curves, all 6 methods, with bootstrap 95% CI\n711\t    bands'\n712\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — information access level (x) vs AUROC at 15%\n713\t    (y), showing lz* at the minimal-information operating point'\n714\t  - 'Fig: DeLong test p-value heatmap, pairwise method comparisons at each contamination\n715\t    level'\n716\t  analysis: '这是 paper story 的关键表格之一。lz* at 5% AUROC=0.705 > Min-K%++ 的同污染级别 不是核心 claim——核心\n717\t    claim 是 \"at the minimal-information operating point,  detection is competitive\n718\t    with privileged methods\"。gap=-0.035 at 15% 且 CI 重叠 直接支持这一论点。图 \"detection frontier\"\n719\t    是 Figure 1 候选——视觉化 information  access vs detection power 的 trade-off frontier。\n720\t\n721\t    '\n722\t- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic (Cross-Benchmark Aggregation)\n723\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n724\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz* 总分。\n725\t    在 PSN-IRT 12 模型 + ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n726\t\n727\t    '\n728\t  expected_results:\n729\t    lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n730\t    lzm_clean_qwen_mean: 12.3\n731\t    lzm_contam15_qwen: 7.8\n732\t    lzm_contam50_qwen: 14.5\n733\t    lzm_clean_llama_mean: 1.2\n734\t    lzm_contam15_llama: -3.5\n735\t    lzm_separation_d_ctrl_contam_15: 3.8\n736\t    lzm_vs_single_benchmark_improvement: +8-12% AUROC for models with mixed contamination\n737\t      profiles\n738\t    lzm_ward_cluster_consistency: identical clustering to per-benchmark analysis in\n739\t      11/12 models\n740\t  result_rationale: 'lzm 聚合跨 benchmark 信号的优势在于：当一个模型在多个 benchmarks 上都有轻微 contamination（如每个\n741\t    benchmark 5%），单个 benchmark 的 lz* 可能不显著（|d|<1）， 但 lzm 通过 sqrt(n_benchmarks) 效应放大\n742\t    combined signal，使联合检测更 powerful。 对于 Gemini-1.5 这种在多个 benchmarks 上都有极端 misfit 的模型，lzm\n743\t    进一步 amplify 信号（45.2 vs 单 benchmark 最高 31.8）。\n744\t\n745\t    然而 lzm 在 ctrl-contam 上的 improvement 有限（+8-12%），因为 ctrl-contam 每次 只 contaminate\n746\t    一个 benchmark，不存在 cross-benchmark 信号叠加。lzm 的真正价值 在于 real-world scenario：模型可能在训练数据中包含多个\n747\t    benchmarks 的 items， lzm 提供了一个 holistic contamination index。\n748\t\n749\t    Ward clustering 一致性 11/12 表明 lzm 没有引入 artifacts——聚合后的 model profiles  保留了 per-benchmark\n750\t    分析发现的 contamination typology。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t  tables:\n754\t  - name: 'Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* (Selected Models)'\n755\t    columns:\n756\t    - Model\n757\t    - lz*_MMLU\n758\t    - lz*_HS\n759\t    - lz*_GSM8K\n760\t    - lzm\n761\t    - Signal Gain\n762\t    rows:\n763\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n764\t      - '31.8'\n765\t      - '28.5'\n766\t      - '12.1'\n767\t      - '45.2'\n768\t      - +42%\n769\t    - - Qwen-clean\n770\t      - '8.7'\n771\t      - '5.2'\n772\t      - '3.1'\n773\t      - '12.3'\n774\t      - +41%\n775\t    - - Qwen-contam15\n776\t      - '3.8'\n777\t      - '2.1'\n778\t      - '1.5'\n779\t      - '7.8'\n780\t      - +37%\n781\t    - - Llama-clean\n782\t      - '-0.1'\n783\t      - '0.3'\n784\t      - '-0.5'\n785\t      - '1.2'\n786\t      - —\n787\t  figures_description:\n788\t  - 'Fig: lzm vs average |lz*| scatter — showing amplification effect for multi-benchmark\n789\t    contamination'\n790\t  analysis: 'P2 priority。在 best 档中作为 \"methodological extension\" 在 Discussion 中简要提及。\n791\t    主要价值是为 future work (leaderboard-scale audit) 提供更 powerful 的 aggregated statistic。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test (GRPO After SFT Contamination)\n795\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n796\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B（或 Qwen3.5-9B）上先 SFT 污染 15% MMLU items，再 GRPO 训练。 测试 person-fit\n797\t    在 RL 后是否保持检测力。同时测试 baselines (Min-K%++, PPL) 在 post-RL 上的表现。\n798\t\n799\t    '\n800\t  expected_results:\n801\t    pre_rl_lz_star_contam15: 3.85\n802\t    pre_rl_cohens_d_contam15: -3.42\n803\t    post_rl_lz_star_contam15: 5.82\n804\t    post_rl_cohens_d_contam15: -2.2\n805\t    post_rl_delta_vs_pre_rl: +1.97 (partial signal recovery)\n806\t    post_rl_detection_retained: true\n807\t    post_rl_retention_rate: 0.64\n808\t    post_rl_min_k_pp_auroc: 0.535\n809\t    post_rl_ppl_auroc: 0.52\n810\t    post_rl_lz_star_auroc: 0.89\n811\t    pre_rl_min_k_pp_auroc: 0.96\n812\t    pre_rl_ppl_auroc: 0.915\n813\t    min_k_pp_degradation: -0.425 AUROC (catastrophic)\n814\t    ppl_degradation: -0.395 AUROC (catastrophic)\n815\t    lz_star_degradation: -0.035 AUROC (minimal)\n816\t    post_rl_theta_shift: 0.15\n817\t    post_rl_memorization_fraction: 0.32\n818\t    post_rl_accuracy_change: -0.008\n819\t    rl_distributional_shift_magnitude: KL(pre||post) = 2.3 nats on token distribution\n820\t  result_rationale: 'Post-RL person-fit 保持检测力（d=2.20，仍远超 2.0 阈值）的根本原因是 structural\n821\t    immunity： lz* 仅依赖 binary response patterns（correct/incorrect），而 GRPO 主要改变 token-level  probability\n822\t    distributions（reasoning style, chain-of-thought format, confidence calibration），\n823\t    不改变 \"哪些 items 被答对/答错\" 的 binary pattern。\n824\t\n825\t    具体机制：(a) SFT 注入的 memorization 是 item-level 的——模型记住了特定 questions 的  answers，这些\n826\t    memories 被编码在 model weights 的 specific directions 中；(b) GRPO  的 reward signal\n827\t    是 outcome-level 的（correct/incorrect），它优化 reasoning strategy  而非 item-specific\n828\t    memories；(c) GRPO 可能 slightly erode memorization（accuracy  drop 0.8%），将 memorization_fraction\n829\t    从 0.38 降至 0.32，因此 d 从 3.42 降至 2.20—— 但这是 partial erosion 而非 catastrophic failure。\n830\t\n831\t    相比之下，Min-K%++ 和 PPL 从 0.96/0.92 暴跌至 ~0.53/0.52（接近 random），因为 GRPO  彻底改变了 token\n832\t    probability distribution——reasoning models 的 token-level statistics  与 base models\n833\t    根本不同（Wang et al. 2025 的核心发现），使得基于 probability 的  contamination 信号完全被 RL-induced\n834\t    distributional shift 淹没。\n835\t\n836\t    这是 paper 最强的 motivation point：\"Binary patterns are structurally immune to  RL-induced\n837\t    distributional shifts that invalidate all log-prob methods.\" retention_rate=64%\n838\t    表明 RL 确实 erode 了部分信号，但剩余信号仍在 d>2 的 strong  effect 范围内，而 log-prob methods 的 retention_rate\n839\t    ≈ 0%。\n840\t\n841\t    '\n842\t  tables:\n843\t  - name: 'Table: Pre-RL vs Post-RL Detection (MMLU, 15% Contamination)'\n844\t    columns:\n845\t    - Method\n846\t    - Pre-RL AUROC\n847\t    - Post-RL AUROC\n848\t    - Δ AUROC\n849\t    - Retained?\n850\t    rows:\n851\t    - - '**lz* (ours)**'\n852\t      - '**0.925**'\n853\t      - '**0.890**'\n854\t      - '**-0.035**'\n855\t      - '**✓**'\n856\t    - - Min-K%++\n857\t      - '0.960'\n858\t      - '0.535'\n859\t      - '-0.425'\n860\t      - ✗\n861\t    - - PPL-based\n862\t      - '0.915'\n863\t      - '0.520'\n864\t      - '-0.395'\n865\t      - ✗\n866\t    - - ConStat\n867\t      - '0.885'\n868\t      - '0.870'\n869\t      - '-0.015'\n870\t      - ✓\n871\t    - - Acc z-score\n872\t      - '0.775'\n873\t      - '0.760'\n874\t      - '-0.015'\n875\t      - ✓\n876\t  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d Pre vs Post RL'\n877\t    columns:\n878\t    - Condition\n879\t    - lz*\n880\t    - Cohen's d\n881\t    - memo_frac\n882\t    rows:\n883\t    - - SFT-only (contam 15%)\n884\t      - '3.85'\n885\t      - '-3.42'\n886\t      - '0.38'\n887\t    - - SFT + GRPO (contam 15%)\n888\t      - '5.82'\n889\t      - '-2.20'\n890\t      - '0.32'\n891\t    - - Clean (post-GRPO)\n892\t      - '8.45'\n893\t      - —\n894\t      - —\n895\t  figures_description:\n896\t  - 'Fig: Pre/Post-RL AUROC comparison — grouped bar chart, all methods side by side,\n897\t    with ''catastrophic failure'' annotation for log-prob methods'\n898\t  - 'Fig: Token distribution KL divergence (pre vs post RL) alongside binary pattern\n899\t    preservation, illustrating structural immunity mechanism'\n900\t  - 'Fig: Detection retention rate — lz* vs log-prob methods, quantifying the structural\n901\t    advantage'\n902\t  analysis: '这是论文 narrative 的杀手级结果。直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 \"all MIA methods fail  under\n903\t    post-RL\"。在 best 档中：lz* d=2.20 (retained) vs Min-K%++ near-random (failed) 成为 Abstract\n904\t    和 Introduction 的 headline。ConStat 也保持检测力（因为 re-test 同样 不依赖 token probs），但需要额外推理开销。Acc\n905\t    z-score 也保持（因为同样 binary-only）， 但 AUROC 远低于 lz*。这完善了 detection frontier：binary\n906\t    methods 在 post-RL 场景下 is the ONLY operating point that works。\n907\t\n908\t    '\n909\t- name: Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH, 1K-10K Gap)\n910\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n911\t  description: '扩展 benchmark 覆盖：BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items)。 填充 simulation\n912\t    power curve 中 1K-10K items 的 gap。 需要 PSN-IRT 或自行校准的 4PL 参数。\n913\t\n914\t    '\n915\t  expected_results:\n916\t    bbh_power_15pct_simulated: 0.875\n917\t    math_power_15pct_simulated: 0.82\n918\t    bbh_power_5pct_simulated: 0.545\n919\t    math_power_5pct_simulated: 0.48\n920\t    bbh_qwen_d_15: -2.1\n921\t    math_qwen_d_15: -1.85\n922\t    bbh_llama_d_15: -1.75\n923\t    math_llama_d_15: -1.55\n924\t    power_theory_with_bbh_math_R2: 0.965\n925\t    gap_filled: 5 benchmarks (1.3K-14K) now provide continuous power curve\n926\t    min_items_15pct_80power_updated: 6200\n927\t  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充了 GSM8K (1.3K) 到 HellaSwag\n928\t    (10K)  之间的关键 gap。BBH 的 6.5K items 对应 power_15%≈0.875，略低于 HellaSwag (0.753  simulated,\n929\t    但 ctrl-contam d≈2.0)，符合 power ∝ √n 的理论关系。\n930\t\n931\t    MATH 的 5K items 对应 power_15%≈0.820，低于 BBH 因为 MATH 的 item 类型（开放式 数学证明/计算）可能使 4PL\n932\t    拟合略差于 multiple-choice format。\n933\t\n934\t    加入 BBH 和 MATH 后，power theory R² 从 0.957 提升到 0.965，因为额外的数据点 减少了 fitting uncertainty。min_items_15pct_80power\n935\t    从 7958 下调到 6200，因为 BBH 和 MATH 的实际数据点显示 中等规模 benchmarks 的 detection 比纯理论预测略好 （4PL\n936\t    parameters 在这些 benchmarks 上的 discrimination 可能略高于 MMLU average）。\n937\t\n938\t    '\n939\t  tables:\n940\t  - name: 'Table: Extended Power Curve (All Benchmarks)'\n941\t    columns:\n942\t    - Benchmark\n943\t    - n_items\n944\t    - Power@15% (sim)\n945\t    - Power@15% (theory)\n946\t    - d@15% (ctrl)\n947\t    rows:\n948\t    - - MMLU\n949\t      - '14042'\n950\t      - '0.985'\n951\t      - '0.980'\n952\t      - '3.09'\n953\t    - - HellaSwag\n954\t      - '10042'\n955\t      - '0.753'\n956\t      - '0.760'\n957\t      - '2.04'\n958\t    - - BBH\n959\t      - '6511'\n960\t      - '0.875'\n961\t      - '0.850'\n962\t      - '2.10'\n963\t    - - MATH\n964\t      - '5000'\n965\t      - '0.820'\n966\t      - '0.790'\n967\t      - '1.85'\n968\t    - - GSM8K\n969\t      - '1319'\n970\t      - '0.591'\n971\t      - '0.580'\n972\t      - '1.40'\n973\t    - - ARC-C\n974\t      - '1172'\n975\t      - '0.129'\n976\t      - '0.140'\n977\t      - —\n978\t    - - HumanEval\n979\t      - '164'\n980\t      - '0.243'\n981\t      - '0.250'\n982\t      - —\n983\t  figures_description:\n984\t  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks, theoretical curve overlay,\n985\t    80% power threshold line intersecting at ~6200 items'\n986\t  analysis: 'P2 priority，但对 Claim 2 的 power function 有显著加强。5 个 ctrl-contam benchmarks  覆盖\n987\t    1.3K-14K 的连续 range，power theory R²=0.965 使得 \"detection power is a  predictable\n988\t    function of n_items\" 从 3-point 外推变为 5-point 验证。\n989\t\n990\t    '\n991\t- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n992\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n993\t  description: 'MMLU subject-level person-fit 分析。识别 contamination 是全面的还是集中在特定 domains。\n994\t    覆盖 PSN-IRT 12 模型。\n995\t\n996\t    '\n997\t  expected_results:\n998\t    gemini_mmlu_accuracy: 1.0\n999\t    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57\n1000\t    gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n1001\t    gemini_category_lz_stem: 21.2\n1002\t    gemini_category_lz_humanities: 17.9\n1003\t    gemini_category_lz_social: 15.9\n1004\t    gemini_category_lz_other: 15.3\n1005\t    doubao_negative_lz: true\n1006\t    doubao_stem_lz: -2.0\n1007\t    doubao_humanities_lz: -13.0\n1008\t    hunyuan_uneven_stem: 1.8\n1009\t    hunyuan_uneven_social: 13.9\n1010\t    yi_lightning_highest: 48.2\n1011\t    n_distinct_contamination_profiles: 3\n1012\t  result_rationale: 'Gemini-1.5 的 50/57 subjects flagged 且 domain-level lz* 相对均匀（STEM\n1013\t    21.2 vs  Other 15.3，ratio=1.39）表明其 MMLU 污染是 comprehensive 而非 domain-specific——\n1014\t    这与 \"training data 中包含完整 MMLU dataset\" 一致（而非只训练了某些 subject areas）。\n1015\t\n1016\t    对比 Doubao 的 strongly negative lz*（尤其 humanities -13.0）和 Hunyuan 的 uneven  profile（STEM\n1017\t    1.8 vs Social Sciences 13.9）揭示了不同的 contamination typology： (a) Doubao 的 negative\n1018\t    lz* 表明 under-performance on \"easy\" items（可能是 training  data 中某些 domains 的 coverage\n1019\t    gap），不是 contamination 而是 response pattern  异质性；(b) Hunyuan 的 uneven profile 暗示\n1020\t    selective domain contamination 或  domain-specific training emphasis。\n1021\t\n1022\t    这三种 profiles（uniform high, selective negative, domain-uneven）形成了 Ward  clustering\n1023\t    中发现的 contamination typology 的 domain-level 解释。\n1024\t\n1025\t    '\n1026\t  tables:\n1027\t  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* Profiles (Selected Models)'\n1028\t    columns:\n1029\t    - Model\n1030\t    - STEM\n1031\t    - Humanities\n1032\t    - Social Sci\n1033\t    - Other\n1034\t    - Profile\n1035\t    rows:\n1036\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n1037\t      - '+21.2'\n1038\t      - '+17.9'\n1039\t      - '+15.9'\n1040\t      - '+15.3'\n1041\t      - Uniform high\n1042\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n1043\t      - '+48.2'\n1044\t      - '+42.1'\n1045\t      - '+38.5'\n1046\t      - '+35.8'\n1047\t      - Uniform extreme\n1048\t    - - Doubao\n1049\t      - '-2.0'\n1050\t      - '-13.0'\n1051\t      - '-14.8'\n1052\t      - '+4.4'\n1053\t      - Selective negative\n1054\t    - - Hunyuan\n1055\t      - '+1.8'\n1056\t      - '+8.5'\n1057\t      - '+13.9'\n1058\t      - '+6.2'\n1059\t      - Domain-uneven\n1060\t  figures_description:\n1061\t  - 'Fig: Domain-level lz* heatmap (12 models × 4 categories), annotated with contamination\n1062\t    typology labels'\n1063\t  - 'Fig: Subject-level lz* distribution for Gemini-1.5 (57 subjects), showing uniformity'\n1064\t  analysis: Domain analysis 丰富了 Claim 3b 的 case study narrative。三种 contamination typology  为\n1065\t    \"contamination is not monolithic\" 提供了 empirical evidence——不同 models 的  training\n1066\t    pipelines 产生 qualitatively different person-fit profiles。\n1067\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d7d40e8-9260-4eeb-8eeb-45e27ed2dc06","uuid":"f922c603-bc13-4318-acc1-84b74b466604","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:06:08.813Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T032820/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。三条 Claim 无需调整。Headline: \"IRT-FIT achieves |d|>2.5\n  across 4 model families at 15% contamination using only binary responses, and retains\n  detection power after RL — structurally immune to the failure mode that invalidates\n  all log-prob methods.\" ctrl-contam 跨 4 家族 + 3 benchmarks 全面验证，θ-fixed 在所有家族恢复单调剂量-响应，memorization\n  fraction 跨家族一致（30-40%），post-RL 结构性优势确认， baseline comparison 表收到 5+ baselines 且 lz*\n  在低污染区间竞争力强。EMNLP 投稿无需妥协。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen2.5-7B × MMLU)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × MMLU, 5 conditions (0%×3 seeds / 15% / 50%)。\n    Go/no-go 信号，验证 Δlz* 显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、seen/unseen memorization fraction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    clean_s1_lz_star: 9.47\n    clean_s2_lz_star: 7.05\n    clean_s3_lz_star: 9.53\n    clean_mean_lz_star: 8.68\n    clean_std_lz_star: 1.41\n    contam_15_lz_star: 3.85\n    contam_50_lz_star: 7.29\n    cohens_d_contam_15_ddof1: -3.42\n    cohens_d_contam_50_ddof1: -0.99\n    contam_15_acc: 0.731\n    contam_50_acc: 0.764\n    clean_mean_acc: 0.679\n    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.38\n    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.29\n    theta_fixed_value: -0.097\n    theta_fixed_contam_15_lz_star: 11.85\n    theta_fixed_contam_50_lz_star: 18.58\n    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio: 3.12\n    theta_fixed_monotonic: true\n    seen_unseen_fingerprint: seen lz*≈0, unseen lz*≈3.1 at 15%\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 基线 misfit 较高（clean lz*≈8.68），这是因为 Qwen 家族经过大规模多阶段训练，\n    其 response pattern 本身就强烈偏离 4PL 预测。QLoRA SFT 15% 注入使模型记住约 38% 的 seen items （SFT\n    泛化效应：不是所有注入 items 都被死记硬背），这些 memorized items 从 aberrant 变为 expected， 拉低 lz*（从\n    8.68 降到 3.85），产生 |d|=3.42 的强效应。50% 注入时 θ-shift 效应主导：θ_MLE 大幅上升 （Δθ=0.47），re-estimated\n    θ 吸收了大部分 aberrance signal，导致 free-θ 下 d 仅 0.99（非单调）。 但 θ-fixed 分析（固定 θ 为 clean\n    baseline）恢复单调：contam_15 Δlz*=3.17, contam_50 Δlz*=9.89， ratio=3.12，因为此时 θ-shift\n    confound 被消除，纯 memorization signal 正确累积。 seen/unseen 分离是最清晰的指纹：memorized items\n    的 response pattern 从 aberrant 变为 model-predicted， 而 unseen items 保持或加剧 aberrance（因\n    θ-shift 导致 ability 高估）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Qwen Pilot — Δlz* by Condition'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - lz*_corrected\n    - Δlz*\n    - Cohen's_d\n    - θ_MLE\n    - Δθ\n    - acc\n    - memo_frac\n    rows:\n    - - clean (n=3)\n      - 8.68±1.41\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '-0.097'\n      - —\n      - '0.679'\n      - —\n    - - contam_15\n      - '3.85'\n      - '-4.83'\n      - '-3.42'\n      - '0.193'\n      - '+0.29'\n      - '0.731'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - contam_50\n      - '7.29'\n      - '-1.39'\n      - '-0.99'\n      - '0.373'\n      - '+0.47'\n      - '0.764'\n      - '0.29'\n  - name: 'Table: θ-fixed Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - lz*_fixed\n    - Δlz*_fixed\n    - ratio_vs_15\n    rows:\n    - - clean\n      - '8.68'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - contam_15\n      - '11.85'\n      - '+3.17'\n      - 1.0×\n    - - contam_50\n      - '18.58'\n      - '+9.89'\n      - 3.12×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response comparison — free-θ (non-monotonic) vs θ-fixed (monotonic),\n    dual y-axis showing lz* and θ_MLE shift'\n  - 'Fig: Seen vs unseen item lz* decomposition at 15% and 50%'\n  analysis: 'Go/no-go 信号明确通过。d=3.42 远超 Cohen''s d=0.8 大效应阈值。θ-shift 机制是方法论贡献： 它解释了为什么\n    free-θ dose-response 可能非单调，以及如何通过 θ-fixed 恢复正确检测特性。 memorization_fraction=0.38\n    意味着 power function 的 upper bound 需要乘以 0.38 才得到 adjusted power——理论预测与实测吻合。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Controlled Contamination (4 Families × 3 Benchmarks × 6 Levels)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '4 模型家族 (Qwen2.5-7B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-4-12B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) ×  6\n    contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU/HellaSwag/GSM8K)。\n    建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 全谱映射。每个 condition 3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_qwen_d_15: -3.42\n    mmlu_qwen_d_50: -0.99\n    mmlu_qwen_d_5: -1.15\n    mmlu_qwen_d_10: -2.3\n    mmlu_qwen_d_25: -2.85\n    mmlu_llama_d_15: -2.95\n    mmlu_llama_d_50: -3.31\n    mmlu_llama_d_5: -1.05\n    mmlu_llama_d_10: -2.1\n    mmlu_llama_d_25: -3.15\n    mmlu_gemma_d_15: -3.2\n    mmlu_gemma_d_50: -2.65\n    mmlu_gemma_d_5: -1.1\n    mmlu_gemma_d_10: -2.25\n    mmlu_gemma_d_25: -3.05\n    mmlu_mistral_d_15: -2.8\n    mmlu_mistral_d_50: -2.5\n    mmlu_mistral_d_5: -0.95\n    mmlu_mistral_d_10: -1.95\n    mmlu_mistral_d_25: -2.7\n    mmlu_d_15_min_across_families: 2.8\n    mmlu_d_15_mean_across_families: 3.09\n    mmlu_n_families_d_gt_2_at_15pct: 4\n    hellaswag_qwen_d_15: -2.35\n    hellaswag_llama_d_15: -1.9\n    hellaswag_gemma_d_15: -2.15\n    hellaswag_mistral_d_15: -1.75\n    hellaswag_d_15_mean: 2.04\n    hellaswag_qwen_d_50: -1.7\n    hellaswag_llama_d_50: -2.55\n    hellaswag_gemma_d_50: -2.3\n    hellaswag_mistral_d_50: -2.1\n    gsm8k_qwen_d_15: -1.65\n    gsm8k_llama_d_15: -1.3\n    gsm8k_gemma_d_15: -1.5\n    gsm8k_mistral_d_15: -1.15\n    gsm8k_d_15_mean: 1.4\n    gsm8k_qwen_d_50: -1.2\n    gsm8k_llama_d_50: -1.8\n    gsm8k_gemma_d_50: -1.6\n    gsm8k_mistral_d_50: -1.45\n    ctrl_contam_cohens_d_15pct_min_across_families: 2.8\n    ctrl_contam_cohens_d_15pct_mean_across_families: 3.09\n    n_families_d_gt_2: 4\n    multi_benchmark_cohens_d_15pct_hellaswag: 2.04\n    multi_benchmark_cohens_d_15pct_gsm8k: 1.4\n    theta_fixed_monotonic_families: 4\n    theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_gemma_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio_range:\n    - 2.5\n    - 3.5\n    memorization_fraction_qwen_15: 0.38\n    memorization_fraction_llama_15: 0.35\n    memorization_fraction_gemma_15: 0.36\n    memorization_fraction_mistral_15: 0.33\n    memorization_fraction_cross_family_mean: 0.355\n    memorization_fraction_range:\n    - 0.33\n    - 0.38\n    power_theory_vs_observed_R2: 0.94\n    adjusted_power_mmlu_15pct: 0.37\n    theoretical_upper_bound_mmlu_15pct: 0.98\n  result_rationale: '四个家族在 MMLU 上均产生 |d|>2.5 的检测信号，原因是 QLoRA SFT 的 memorization 机制跨家族一致：\n    无论模型架构（Qwen=grouped-query attention, Llama=RoPE+GQA, Gemma=sliding window,  Mistral=sliding\n    window attention），SFT 在 1-3 epochs 内均会将约 33-38% 的注入 items 从 \"能力匹配的随机正确/错误\" 变为\n    \"确定性正确\"，产生与 IRT 4PL 预测的系统性偏离。\n\n    家族间差异由 baseline misfit 幅度调控：Qwen 基线 lz*≈8.68（高 misfit）使得 free-θ 非单调更明显；Llama 基线\n    lz*≈-0.14（接近 0）使得 free-θ 基本单调。Gemma 和 Mistral  预期基线 misfit 在 2-6 之间（中等），free-θ\n    行为介于两者之间。但 θ-fixed 在所有家族恢复单调， 因为固定 θ 消除了 θ-shift confound 这个唯一的干扰因素。\n\n    HellaSwag 效应弱于 MMLU（d_15 mean=2.04 vs 3.09），原因：(a) items 数少（~10K vs 14K）， lz*\n    方差 ∝ 1/√n，信号-噪声比降低；(b) HellaSwag 是 sentence completion 任务，SFT memorization 的 transfer\n    pattern 可能不同于 MMLU 的 multiple-choice 格式。但仍在 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内。\n\n    GSM8K 效应最弱（d_15 mean=1.40），因为仅 ~1.3K items，接近 power function 预测的 min_items_15pct_80power=7958\n    的下限。但 |d|>1.0 仍是大效应，且与理论 power function 吻合（R²=0.94），验证了 Claim 2 \"detection power\n    is a predictable function of n_items\"。\n\n    memorization_fraction 跨家族一致（0.33-0.38）的理论解释：QLoRA 的 low-rank bottleneck （rank=16-64）限制了\n    SFT 的记忆容量，使得不同家族模型在相同注入量下记住相似比例的 items。 这个一致性支持了 \"memorization fraction 是 SFT\n    过程的通用属性\" 这一论点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d at 15% Contamination (4 Families × 3 Benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - Family\n    - MMLU (14K)\n    - HellaSwag (10K)\n    - GSM8K (1.3K)\n    - memo_frac\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n      - '-3.42'\n      - '-2.35'\n      - '-1.65'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '-2.95'\n      - '-1.90'\n      - '-1.30'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - Gemma-4-12B\n      - '-3.20'\n      - '-2.15'\n      - '-1.50'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - '-2.80'\n      - '-1.75'\n      - '-1.15'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - '**Mean**'\n      - '**-3.09**'\n      - '**-2.04**'\n      - '**-1.40**'\n      - '**0.355**'\n    - - '**Min |d|**'\n      - '**2.80**'\n      - '**1.75**'\n      - '**1.15**'\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table: Full Dose-Response (MMLU, θ-fixed, 4 Families)'\n    columns:\n    - Family\n    - d_5%\n    - d_10%\n    - d_15%\n    - d_25%\n    - d_50%\n    - monotonic\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n      - '1.15'\n      - '2.30'\n      - '3.42'\n      - '4.85'\n      - '9.89'\n      - ✓\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '0.90'\n      - '1.85'\n      - '2.95'\n      - '4.50'\n      - '8.75'\n      - ✓\n    - - Gemma-4-12B\n      - '1.00'\n      - '2.05'\n      - '3.20'\n      - '4.65'\n      - '9.30'\n      - ✓\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - '0.85'\n      - '1.75'\n      - '2.80'\n      - '4.20'\n      - '8.40'\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table: Seen/Unseen Memorization Split at 15% (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Family\n    - Δacc_seen\n    - Δacc_unseen\n    - seen_lz*\n    - unseen_lz*\n    - memo_frac\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - '+0.142'\n      - '+0.010'\n      - ≈0\n      - '+3.1'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Llama\n      - '+0.135'\n      - '+0.008'\n      - ≈0\n      - '+2.8'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - Gemma\n      - '+0.138'\n      - '+0.009'\n      - ≈0\n      - '+2.9'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - Mistral\n      - '+0.128'\n      - '+0.006'\n      - ≈0\n      - '+2.6'\n      - '0.33'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-panel dose-response curves (one per family), θ-fixed, MMLU+HellaSwag+GSM8K\n    overlaid, showing monotonic increase and benchmark-size effect'\n  - 'Fig: Cross-family Cohen''s d heatmap (4 families × 3 benchmarks × 6 levels),\n    color-coded by effect size'\n  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction consistency plot — bar chart across 4 families showing\n    0.33-0.38 range with error bars'\n  - 'Fig: Theoretical power (upper bound) vs adjusted power (× memo_frac) vs observed\n    detection rate, three curves per benchmark'\n  analysis: '这是论文的核心实验。4/4 家族 |d|>2.0 at 15% 直接验证 Claim 1 的跨家族泛化。 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K\n    的检测力与 benchmark size 的关系验证 Claim 2 的 power function。 θ-fixed 4/4 家族单调是方法论贡献的关键证据。memorization\n    fraction 0.33-0.38 的跨家族一致性 弥合了 theoretical upper bound 与 observed detection 之间的\n    gap（R²=0.94）， 完成 Claim 2 的 \"predictable power function\" 论证。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Audit (ABANDONED)\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描。因 D011 (v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111) 和 item\n    alignment 54.56% 导致不可行，已放弃。数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: ABANDONED\n    reason: IRT refit discrimination failure (a_r=0.111 << 0.2 threshold) + item alignment\n      54.56%\n    paper_treatment: 'Discussion/Future Work: 13K+ per-item data publicly available\n      for future large-scale audits'\n  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，v1 IRT refit 的 discrimination 参数仍然不可能达标（a_r 需 >0.4），\n    因为经典 IRT (MML-EM) 和 neural IRT (PSN-IRT) 的估计基于根本不同的优化目标和样本量要求。 N=178 的经典 IRT 样本远不足以恢复\n    neural IRT 在 N=12 精选模型上的区分度。 这是一个关于 classical vs neural IRT estimation 的 methodological\n    caveat， 本身就是贡献（Claim 3c）。在 best tier，ctrl-contam 提供了比 leaderboard audit  更强的验证（ground\n    truth），使得 audit 变为 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Abandoned 不影响 best 档叙事。ctrl-contam 是 primary validation，leaderboard audit  是\n    future work。13K+ 数据可用性作为 \"IRT-FIT uniquely suited for retrospective audit\"  的论据保留在\n    Discussion 中。\n\n    '\n- name: Base→Chat Natural Experiment (v1 Leaderboard Pairs)\n  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 自然实验。计算 Δlz* = lz*(chat) - lz*(base)  作为\n    SFT 效应代理。P2-optional。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_pairs: 21\n    n_complete_pairs: 9\n    hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n    hellaswag_t_stat: -3.97\n    hellaswag_p_value: 0.001\n    gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.92\n    gsm8k_t_stat: 3.35\n    gsm8k_p_value: 0.009\n    mmlu_p_value: 0.15\n    arc_c_p_value: 0.38\n    individual_outliers: 0\n  result_rationale: 'HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 显示系统性 SFT 效应的原因：(a) HellaSwag 的 sentence completion  任务格式使得\n    chat-tuned 模型的 response pattern 系统性偏离 base model（instruction  following 改变了选择策略），产生负向\n    Δlz*；(b) GSM8K 的数学推理任务在 chat tuning 中 经常被加强（chain-of-thought data 常包含 GSM8K-style\n    problems），产生正向 Δlz*。 MMLU 和 ARC-C 不显著是因为 SFT 对这两个 benchmark 的 response pattern\n    影响更分散， 不同 subject domains 的效应相互抵消。在 best tier 下，这些结果作为 ctrl-contam 的 补充证据——自然\n    SFT 确实改变 person-fit，但不如 controlled contamination 那么强或定向。 没有单个 pair 显示 benchmark-specific\n    contamination outlier 说明自然 SFT 的效应是 distributed 而非 memorization-like。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Base→Chat Δlz* by Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Mean Δlz*\n    - t-stat\n    - p-value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '-3.40'\n      - '-3.97'\n      - '0.001'\n      - SFT systematically decreases lz*\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '+3.92'\n      - '+3.35'\n      - '0.009'\n      - SFT systematically increases lz*\n    - - MMLU\n      - '+1.85'\n      - '+1.52'\n      - '0.15'\n      - Not significant\n    - - ARC-C\n      - '-0.72'\n      - '-0.91'\n      - '0.38'\n      - Not significant\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Paired Δlz* scatter plot (base vs chat) per benchmark, highlighting systematic\n    shift direction'\n  analysis: 'P2-optional 补充实验。在 best 档叙事中作为 \"SFT changes person-fit profiles\" 的 converging\n    evidence，支持 ctrl-contam 的 mechanistic story，但不是核心依据。\n\n    '\n- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178, Path D Closure)\n  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N=178。最终确认 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。 关闭 Path\n    D。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_downloaded: 178\n    n_items: 14042\n    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.127\n    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.029\n    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.663\n    a_r_threshold_met: false\n    path_d_conclusion: dead\n    b_r_partial_validation: 0.663\n  result_rationale: 'N=178 仍远不足以弥合经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 的 discrimination 估计差异。原因： (a)\n    MML-EM 在 N=178 heterogeneous LLMs 上估计的 a_r 反映的是 \"average discriminability  across\n    very different response strategies\"，而 PSN-IRT 在 N=12 curated models 上 用 deep learning\n    捕获的是 \"local discriminability near the ability frontier\"—— 两种估计回答的是不同问题。(b) b_r=0.663\n    部分验证成功是因为 item difficulty 是一个 更 robust 的参数（在 item 排序上，classical 和 neural 估计更一致），而\n    discrimination 需要模型在 ability frontier 附近有足够密度的采样点。(c) 即使 N→500+，a_r 预计仍 <0.2，\n    因为根本问题是 heterogeneity 而非 sample size。 在 best tier 下这是一个 positive negative result：它量化了\n    classical-vs-neural IRT  的 sample size gap，motivates future work on neural IRT\n    scaling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IRT Refit — Pilot vs Expanded'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Pilot (N=63)\n    - Expanded (N=178)\n    - Threshold\n    rows:\n    - - 3PL a_r (Pearson)\n      - '0.111'\n      - '0.127'\n      - '>0.4'\n    - - 2PL a_r (Pearson)\n      - '-0.084'\n      - '-0.029'\n      - '>0.4'\n    - - 3PL b_r (Pearson)\n      - '0.626'\n      - '0.663'\n      - '>0.5 ✓'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: a_r vs sample size (N=63, 178), extrapolation curve showing convergence\n    well below threshold'\n  analysis: 'Path D 最终关闭。b_r 部分验证 + a_r 失败 → Claim 3c 的内容： \"IRT parameter estimation\n    challenges — quantifying the sample size gap between  classical and neural IRT\n    estimation in LLM contexts.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '比较 4PL 和 3PL(d=1) 下的检测灵敏度。量化 feasibility parameter d 对 false alarm\n    rate 和 detection power 的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    far_4pl: 0.05\n    far_3pl: 4.7-16.5%\n    far_2pl: 50-100%\n    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_mmlu: +27.3pp\n    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_hellaswag: +26.1pp\n    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl_gsm8k: +20.3pp\n    pct_mmlu_items_d_lt_095: 0.46\n    most_affected_model: DeepSeek-V3 (Δlz*=357)\n    real_data_correlation_4pl_vs_3pl: 0.225\n    real_data_rmse: 68.41\n  result_rationale: '4PL d parameter 对 LLM contamination detection 至关重要的原因：LLM 不是人类考生，\n    它们对某些 items 有系统性的 \"blind spots\"（即使 ability 很高也无法正确回答）。 4PL 的 d parameter（upper\n    asymptote < 1.0）建模了这种 ceiling effect。 46% 的 MMLU items 有 d<0.95，意味着近一半 items 的\n    \"满分\" 低于 1.0。 忽略 d (3PL, d=1) 会使高能力模型的 few-error pattern 被严重高估为 aberrant （因为 model\n    预期 P(correct)→1.0 但 data 允许 P<1.0），inflating false alarm rate。 在 contamination\n    detection 中，这相当于把 \"正常的 ceiling effect miss\" 误判为  \"contamination signal\"，halving\n    detection power 因为 signal-to-noise ratio 被 inflated FAR 压缩。2PL 完全 miscalibrated\n    因为同时忽略了 guessing (c) 和 ceiling (d)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Power Comparison at 25% Contamination'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - 4PL Power\n    - 3PL Power\n    - Gain\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - '0.776'\n      - '0.329'\n      - +44.7pp\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '0.534'\n      - '0.280'\n      - +25.4pp\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '0.730'\n      - '0.334'\n      - +39.6pp\n    - - ARC-C\n      - '0.132'\n      - '0.091'\n      - +4.1pp\n    - - HumanEval\n      - '0.318'\n      - '0.165'\n      - +15.3pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Side-by-side power curves (4PL vs 3PL) across contamination levels, per\n    benchmark'\n  - 'Fig: Item-level Δlz*(4PL-3PL) vs d parameter scatter, showing d<0.95 items drive\n    divergence'\n  analysis: '4PL ablation 是 Reviewer R8 的直接回应。在 best 档中，这个结果为 \"why 4PL, not 3PL\"  提供了定量理由，同时揭示了一个更广泛的\n    insight：LLM person-fit analysis 必须考虑 upper asymptote，因为 LLM 的 \"guessing and ceiling\n    behavior\" 与人类根本不同。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison (≥5 Methods)\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth models 上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines 的 AUROC/Type-I\n    error。 Baselines: ConStat, Min-K%++, accuracy z-score, PPL-based, random。 Bootstrap\n    CIs 作为差异化优势。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_15pct_lz_star: 0.925\n    auroc_15pct_min_k_pp: 0.96\n    auroc_15pct_ppl: 0.915\n    auroc_15pct_constat: 0.885\n    auroc_15pct_acc_zscore: 0.775\n    auroc_15pct_random: 0.5\n    auroc_5pct_lz_star: 0.705\n    auroc_5pct_min_k_pp: 0.745\n    auroc_5pct_ppl: 0.68\n    auroc_5pct_constat: 0.65\n    auroc_5pct_acc_zscore: 0.575\n    auroc_5pct_random: 0.5\n    auroc_50pct_lz_star: 0.98\n    auroc_50pct_min_k_pp: 0.995\n    auroc_50pct_ppl: 0.985\n    auroc_50pct_constat: 0.965\n    auroc_50pct_acc_zscore: 0.92\n    auroc_50pct_random: 0.5\n    baseline_auroc_gap_at_15pct_vs_best_privileged: -0.035\n    baseline_auroc_lz_at_5pct: 0.705\n    lz_star_rank_at_5pct: 1\n    lz_star_rank_at_15pct: 2\n    lz_star_rank_at_50pct: 4\n    ci_95_lz_star_15pct:\n    - 0.885\n    - 0.96\n    ci_95_min_k_pp_15pct:\n    - 0.93\n    - 0.985\n    ci_95_overlap_lz_vs_minkpp: true\n    type_i_lz_star: 0.048\n    type_i_min_k_pp: 0.052\n    type_i_ppl: 0.055\n    type_i_constat: 0.045\n    type_i_acc_zscore: 0.035\n  result_rationale: 'lz* 在 5% 低污染区间排名第一（AUROC=0.705），原因：在信号极弱时，IRT 的结构性归纳偏置 （item\n    difficulty + discrimination + ability 的联合建模）比需要训练数据的 ML 方法 或依赖 token-level 信号的\n    MIA 方法更能从噪声中提取微弱的 aberrance pattern。 具体机制：lz* 将每个 item response 按其 IRT-predicted\n    probability 加权，使得 \"高难度 item 被正确回答\" 比 \"低难度 item 被正确回答\" 贡献更多检测信号。这种加权 在低污染时尤为关键——5%\n    contamination 仅影响 ~700 items (MMLU)，其中 memorized  items (~250) 分散在不同难度层级，IRT 加权使得\n    high-difficulty memorized items  的信号被放大，而 accuracy z-score 等方法对所有 items 等权处理，信号被稀释。\n\n    Min-K%++ 在 15%+ 超过 lz* 是因为 token-level probability 包含比 binary response  更丰富的信息——这正是\n    \"minimal-information operating point\" 的代价所在。 但 gap 仅 -0.035 AUROC，且 95% CIs 重叠，说明\n    binary-only 检测的代价远小于直觉预期。\n\n    PPL-based 和 ConStat 排在 lz* 之后或之间，因为 PPL 依赖 aggregated perplexity （丢失了 item-level\n    结构），ConStat 依赖 re-test（需要额外推理开销）。\n\n    Bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行论文不报告的差异化优势——在 best tier，CI 重叠明确表明 \"lz* 在低污染区间与 privileged\n    methods 竞争力相当\"，而非声称 superiority。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Info Level\n    - 5%\n    - 10%\n    - 15%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - Avg\n    rows:\n    - - '**lz* (ours)**'\n      - '**binary**'\n      - '**0.705**'\n      - '**0.830**'\n      - '**0.925**'\n      - '**0.965**'\n      - '**0.980**'\n      - '**0.881**'\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token probs\n      - '0.745'\n      - '0.870'\n      - '0.960'\n      - '0.990'\n      - '0.995'\n      - '0.912'\n    - - PPL-based\n      - log-probs\n      - '0.680'\n      - '0.810'\n      - '0.915'\n      - '0.970'\n      - '0.985'\n      - '0.872'\n    - - ConStat\n      - re-test\n      - '0.650'\n      - '0.780'\n      - '0.885'\n      - '0.950'\n      - '0.965'\n      - '0.846'\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - binary\n      - '0.575'\n      - '0.680'\n      - '0.775'\n      - '0.885'\n      - '0.920'\n      - '0.767'\n    - - Random\n      - —\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.500'\n  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap 95% CIs at 15% (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - AUROC\n    - 95% CI\n    - Type I\n    rows:\n    - - lz*\n      - '0.925'\n      - '[0.885, 0.960]'\n      - '0.048'\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - '0.960'\n      - '[0.930, 0.985]'\n      - '0.052'\n    - - PPL\n      - '0.915'\n      - '[0.870, 0.955]'\n      - '0.055'\n    - - ConStat\n      - '0.885'\n      - '[0.840, 0.925]'\n      - '0.045'\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - '0.775'\n      - '[0.720, 0.830]'\n      - '0.035'\n  - name: 'Table: Information Access Level Taxonomy'\n    columns:\n    - Level\n    - Methods\n    - Requires\n    rows:\n    - - Binary (minimal)\n      - lz*, Acc z-score\n      - Only correct/incorrect per item\n    - - Re-test\n      - ConStat\n      - Second inference pass with rephrased items\n    - - Token probs\n      - Min-K%++\n      - Per-token probability access\n    - - Log-probs\n      - PPL-based\n      - Sequence-level log-probability\n    - - Weights\n      - Probing\n      - Full model weight access\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: AUROC vs contamination level curves, all 6 methods, with bootstrap 95% CI\n    bands'\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — information access level (x) vs AUROC at 15%\n    (y), showing lz* at the minimal-information operating point'\n  - 'Fig: DeLong test p-value heatmap, pairwise method comparisons at each contamination\n    level'\n  analysis: '这是 paper story 的关键表格之一。lz* at 5% AUROC=0.705 > Min-K%++ 的同污染级别 不是核心 claim——核心\n    claim 是 \"at the minimal-information operating point,  detection is competitive\n    with privileged methods\"。gap=-0.035 at 15% 且 CI 重叠 直接支持这一论点。图 \"detection frontier\"\n    是 Figure 1 候选——视觉化 information  access vs detection power 的 trade-off frontier。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic (Cross-Benchmark Aggregation)\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz* 总分。\n    在 PSN-IRT 12 模型 + ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n    lzm_clean_qwen_mean: 12.3\n    lzm_contam15_qwen: 7.8\n    lzm_contam50_qwen: 14.5\n    lzm_clean_llama_mean: 1.2\n    lzm_contam15_llama: -3.5\n    lzm_separation_d_ctrl_contam_15: 3.8\n    lzm_vs_single_benchmark_improvement: +8-12% AUROC for models with mixed contamination\n      profiles\n    lzm_ward_cluster_consistency: identical clustering to per-benchmark analysis in\n      11/12 models\n  result_rationale: 'lzm 聚合跨 benchmark 信号的优势在于：当一个模型在多个 benchmarks 上都有轻微 contamination（如每个\n    benchmark 5%），单个 benchmark 的 lz* 可能不显著（|d|<1）， 但 lzm 通过 sqrt(n_benchmarks) 效应放大\n    combined signal，使联合检测更 powerful。 对于 Gemini-1.5 这种在多个 benchmarks 上都有极端 misfit 的模型，lzm\n    进一步 amplify 信号（45.2 vs 单 benchmark 最高 31.8）。\n\n    然而 lzm 在 ctrl-contam 上的 improvement 有限（+8-12%），因为 ctrl-contam 每次 只 contaminate\n    一个 benchmark，不存在 cross-benchmark 信号叠加。lzm 的真正价值 在于 real-world scenario：模型可能在训练数据中包含多个\n    benchmarks 的 items， lzm 提供了一个 holistic contamination index。\n\n    Ward clustering 一致性 11/12 表明 lzm 没有引入 artifacts——聚合后的 model profiles  保留了 per-benchmark\n    分析发现的 contamination typology。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* (Selected Models)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - lz*_MMLU\n    - lz*_HS\n    - lz*_GSM8K\n    - lzm\n    - Signal Gain\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - '31.8'\n      - '28.5'\n      - '12.1'\n      - '45.2'\n      - +42%\n    - - Qwen-clean\n      - '8.7'\n      - '5.2'\n      - '3.1'\n      - '12.3'\n      - +41%\n    - - Qwen-contam15\n      - '3.8'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '1.5'\n      - '7.8'\n      - +37%\n    - - Llama-clean\n      - '-0.1'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '-0.5'\n      - '1.2'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lzm vs average |lz*| scatter — showing amplification effect for multi-benchmark\n    contamination'\n  analysis: 'P2 priority。在 best 档中作为 \"methodological extension\" 在 Discussion 中简要提及。\n    主要价值是为 future work (leaderboard-scale audit) 提供更 powerful 的 aggregated statistic。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test (GRPO After SFT Contamination)\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B（或 Qwen3.5-9B）上先 SFT 污染 15% MMLU items，再 GRPO 训练。 测试 person-fit\n    在 RL 后是否保持检测力。同时测试 baselines (Min-K%++, PPL) 在 post-RL 上的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pre_rl_lz_star_contam15: 3.85\n    pre_rl_cohens_d_contam15: -3.42\n    post_rl_lz_star_contam15: 5.82\n    post_rl_cohens_d_contam15: -2.2\n    post_rl_delta_vs_pre_rl: +1.97 (partial signal recovery)\n    post_rl_detection_retained: true\n    post_rl_retention_rate: 0.64\n    post_rl_min_k_pp_auroc: 0.535\n    post_rl_ppl_auroc: 0.52\n    post_rl_lz_star_auroc: 0.89\n    pre_rl_min_k_pp_auroc: 0.96\n    pre_rl_ppl_auroc: 0.915\n    min_k_pp_degradation: -0.425 AUROC (catastrophic)\n    ppl_degradation: -0.395 AUROC (catastrophic)\n    lz_star_degradation: -0.035 AUROC (minimal)\n    post_rl_theta_shift: 0.15\n    post_rl_memorization_fraction: 0.32\n    post_rl_accuracy_change: -0.008\n    rl_distributional_shift_magnitude: KL(pre||post) = 2.3 nats on token distribution\n  result_rationale: 'Post-RL person-fit 保持检测力（d=2.20，仍远超 2.0 阈值）的根本原因是 structural\n    immunity： lz* 仅依赖 binary response patterns（correct/incorrect），而 GRPO 主要改变 token-level  probability\n    distributions（reasoning style, chain-of-thought format, confidence calibration），\n    不改变 \"哪些 items 被答对/答错\" 的 binary pattern。\n\n    具体机制：(a) SFT 注入的 memorization 是 item-level 的——模型记住了特定 questions 的  answers，这些\n    memories 被编码在 model weights 的 specific directions 中；(b) GRPO  的 reward signal\n    是 outcome-level 的（correct/incorrect），它优化 reasoning strategy  而非 item-specific\n    memories；(c) GRPO 可能 slightly erode memorization（accuracy  drop 0.8%），将 memorization_fraction\n    从 0.38 降至 0.32，因此 d 从 3.42 降至 2.20—— 但这是 partial erosion 而非 catastrophic failure。\n\n    相比之下，Min-K%++ 和 PPL 从 0.96/0.92 暴跌至 ~0.53/0.52（接近 random），因为 GRPO  彻底改变了 token\n    probability distribution——reasoning models 的 token-level statistics  与 base models\n    根本不同（Wang et al. 2025 的核心发现），使得基于 probability 的  contamination 信号完全被 RL-induced\n    distributional shift 淹没。\n\n    这是 paper 最强的 motivation point：\"Binary patterns are structurally immune to  RL-induced\n    distributional shifts that invalidate all log-prob methods.\" retention_rate=64%\n    表明 RL 确实 erode 了部分信号，但剩余信号仍在 d>2 的 strong  effect 范围内，而 log-prob methods 的 retention_rate\n    ≈ 0%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Pre-RL vs Post-RL Detection (MMLU, 15% Contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Pre-RL AUROC\n    - Post-RL AUROC\n    - Δ AUROC\n    - Retained?\n    rows:\n    - - '**lz* (ours)**'\n      - '**0.925**'\n      - '**0.890**'\n      - '**-0.035**'\n      - '**✓**'\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - '0.960'\n      - '0.535'\n      - '-0.425'\n      - ✗\n    - - PPL-based\n      - '0.915'\n      - '0.520'\n      - '-0.395'\n      - ✗\n    - - ConStat\n      - '0.885'\n      - '0.870'\n      - '-0.015'\n      - ✓\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - '0.775'\n      - '0.760'\n      - '-0.015'\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d Pre vs Post RL'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - lz*\n    - Cohen's d\n    - memo_frac\n    rows:\n    - - SFT-only (contam 15%)\n      - '3.85'\n      - '-3.42'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - SFT + GRPO (contam 15%)\n      - '5.82'\n      - '-2.20'\n      - '0.32'\n    - - Clean (post-GRPO)\n      - '8.45'\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Pre/Post-RL AUROC comparison — grouped bar chart, all methods side by side,\n    with ''catastrophic failure'' annotation for log-prob methods'\n  - 'Fig: Token distribution KL divergence (pre vs post RL) alongside binary pattern\n    preservation, illustrating structural immunity mechanism'\n  - 'Fig: Detection retention rate — lz* vs log-prob methods, quantifying the structural\n    advantage'\n  analysis: '这是论文 narrative 的杀手级结果。直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 \"all MIA methods fail  under\n    post-RL\"。在 best 档中：lz* d=2.20 (retained) vs Min-K%++ near-random (failed) 成为 Abstract\n    和 Introduction 的 headline。ConStat 也保持检测力（因为 re-test 同样 不依赖 token probs），但需要额外推理开销。Acc\n    z-score 也保持（因为同样 binary-only）， 但 AUROC 远低于 lz*。这完善了 detection frontier：binary\n    methods 在 post-RL 场景下 is the ONLY operating point that works。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH, 1K-10K Gap)\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: '扩展 benchmark 覆盖：BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items)。 填充 simulation\n    power curve 中 1K-10K items 的 gap。 需要 PSN-IRT 或自行校准的 4PL 参数。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_power_15pct_simulated: 0.875\n    math_power_15pct_simulated: 0.82\n    bbh_power_5pct_simulated: 0.545\n    math_power_5pct_simulated: 0.48\n    bbh_qwen_d_15: -2.1\n    math_qwen_d_15: -1.85\n    bbh_llama_d_15: -1.75\n    math_llama_d_15: -1.55\n    power_theory_with_bbh_math_R2: 0.965\n    gap_filled: 5 benchmarks (1.3K-14K) now provide continuous power curve\n    min_items_15pct_80power_updated: 6200\n  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充了 GSM8K (1.3K) 到 HellaSwag\n    (10K)  之间的关键 gap。BBH 的 6.5K items 对应 power_15%≈0.875，略低于 HellaSwag (0.753  simulated,\n    但 ctrl-contam d≈2.0)，符合 power ∝ √n 的理论关系。\n\n    MATH 的 5K items 对应 power_15%≈0.820，低于 BBH 因为 MATH 的 item 类型（开放式 数学证明/计算）可能使 4PL\n    拟合略差于 multiple-choice format。\n\n    加入 BBH 和 MATH 后，power theory R² 从 0.957 提升到 0.965，因为额外的数据点 减少了 fitting uncertainty。min_items_15pct_80power\n    从 7958 下调到 6200，因为 BBH 和 MATH 的实际数据点显示 中等规模 benchmarks 的 detection 比纯理论预测略好 （4PL\n    parameters 在这些 benchmarks 上的 discrimination 可能略高于 MMLU average）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Extended Power Curve (All Benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - Power@15% (sim)\n    - Power@15% (theory)\n    - d@15% (ctrl)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - '14042'\n      - '0.985'\n      - '0.980'\n      - '3.09'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '10042'\n      - '0.753'\n      - '0.760'\n      - '2.04'\n    - - BBH\n      - '6511'\n      - '0.875'\n      - '0.850'\n      - '2.10'\n    - - MATH\n      - '5000'\n      - '0.820'\n      - '0.790'\n      - '1.85'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '1319'\n      - '0.591'\n      - '0.580'\n      - '1.40'\n    - - ARC-C\n      - '1172'\n      - '0.129'\n      - '0.140'\n      - —\n    - - HumanEval\n      - '164'\n      - '0.243'\n      - '0.250'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks, theoretical curve overlay,\n    80% power threshold line intersecting at ~6200 items'\n  analysis: 'P2 priority，但对 Claim 2 的 power function 有显著加强。5 个 ctrl-contam benchmarks  覆盖\n    1.3K-14K 的连续 range，power theory R²=0.965 使得 \"detection power is a  predictable\n    function of n_items\" 从 3-point 外推变为 5-point 验证。\n\n    '\n- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: 'MMLU subject-level person-fit 分析。识别 contamination 是全面的还是集中在特定 domains。\n    覆盖 PSN-IRT 12 模型。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini_mmlu_accuracy: 1.0\n    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57\n    gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n    gemini_category_lz_stem: 21.2\n    gemini_category_lz_humanities: 17.9\n    gemini_category_lz_social: 15.9\n    gemini_category_lz_other: 15.3\n    doubao_negative_lz: true\n    doubao_stem_lz: -2.0\n    doubao_humanities_lz: -13.0\n    hunyuan_uneven_stem: 1.8\n    hunyuan_uneven_social: 13.9\n    yi_lightning_highest: 48.2\n    n_distinct_contamination_profiles: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Gemini-1.5 的 50/57 subjects flagged 且 domain-level lz* 相对均匀（STEM\n    21.2 vs  Other 15.3，ratio=1.39）表明其 MMLU 污染是 comprehensive 而非 domain-specific——\n    这与 \"training data 中包含完整 MMLU dataset\" 一致（而非只训练了某些 subject areas）。\n\n    对比 Doubao 的 strongly negative lz*（尤其 humanities -13.0）和 Hunyuan 的 uneven  profile（STEM\n    1.8 vs Social Sciences 13.9）揭示了不同的 contamination typology： (a) Doubao 的 negative\n    lz* 表明 under-performance on \"easy\" items（可能是 training  data 中某些 domains 的 coverage\n    gap），不是 contamination 而是 response pattern  异质性；(b) Hunyuan 的 uneven profile 暗示\n    selective domain contamination 或  domain-specific training emphasis。\n\n    这三种 profiles（uniform high, selective negative, domain-uneven）形成了 Ward  clustering\n    中发现的 contamination typology 的 domain-level 解释。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* Profiles (Selected Models)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - STEM\n    - Humanities\n    - Social Sci\n    - Other\n    - Profile\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - '+21.2'\n      - '+17.9'\n      - '+15.9'\n      - '+15.3'\n      - Uniform high\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - '+48.2'\n      - '+42.1'\n      - '+38.5'\n      - '+35.8'\n      - Uniform extreme\n    - - Doubao\n      - '-2.0'\n      - '-13.0'\n      - '-14.8'\n      - '+4.4'\n      - Selective negative\n    - - Hunyuan\n      - '+1.8'\n      - '+8.5'\n      - '+13.9'\n      - '+6.2'\n      - Domain-uneven\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Domain-level lz* heatmap (12 models × 4 categories), annotated with contamination\n    typology labels'\n  - 'Fig: Subject-level lz* distribution for Gemini-1.5 (57 subjects), showing uniformity'\n  analysis: Domain analysis 丰富了 Claim 3b 的 case study narrative。三种 contamination typology  为\n    \"contamination is not monolithic\" 提供了 empirical evidence——不同 models 的  training\n    pipelines 产生 qualitatively different person-fit profiles。\n","numLines":1067,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1067}}}
